    @functools.wrap(fn)
    def mark(f: Callable[_P, _R]) -> Callable[_P, _R]:
```

This leads to duplicate test names:

```python
# tests/foo/test_a.py
@mlflow.test
def test_foo():
    ...


# tests/bar/test_a.py
@mlflow.test
def test_foo():
    ...
```

