I would imagine it to be somewhat like this:

```py
METRICS_MIXED_INPUT: list = [
    {
        "metric_name": accuracy_score,
        "data": ["binary"],
        "checks": ["default"],
        "metric_kwargs": ["normalize", "sample_weight"]
