Then, this list of dict would be used to look up the "configs" of this test case. The data used in case of "binary", or "sample_weight" and so on would still be defined outside of this dict.

```suggestion
    if metric_name in CLASSIFICATION_METRICS:
        # These should all accept binary label input as there are no
